{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026MF9zkNcfbJ1792942258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>高級組銀牌足球賽，理文4-2擊敗標準流浪。</p><p></p><p>黃衫理文16分鐘先失守，流浪的伊巴謙以一敵二，再笠過門將入網，射成1-0。不過32分鐘被追平，理文的韋利安遠射，門將陳嘉豪拍到都入。換邊後6分鐘，米高在小禁區邊一控一射，為理文反先2-1。</p><p></p><p>雖然流浪憑保利奧接應角球後，在「K角位」彎入，74分鐘追平。但只是2分鐘後，保亞馬天尼斯後上射入，為理文第二度領先。加上卡拉夫補時1分鐘「埋齋」，為理文鎖定贏4-2，晉級四強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.537533+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T15:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T21:18:08.229658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:27.427049+00:00","content_hash":"a5dc3a294243c5020b25356b19881795606ba6c52781d815537b5c9803401709","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.537533+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}